=begin pod

=TITLE Web Framework Troupe

=head1 Purpose

The B<Web Framework Troupe> maintain the software that powers many of the Raku 
websites.  

The Web Framework Troupe has two major projects:
=item raku.org (the main website)
=item Elucid8 (for documentation)

=head1 raku.org

This is the main Raku website.  Its purpose is to welcome newcomers to Raku, and 
draw them into the community.  

=head2 Resources

=head3 Code Repositories

=item L<Source for existing raku.org|https://github.com/Raku/raku.org>
=item L<Branch with new prototype raku.org|https://github.com/Raku/raku.org/tree/proto-25>

=head3 IRC channels

For information about the IRC channels, see the L<#raku IRC channel|https://raku.org/community/irc/> page.

Discuss with this crew on #raku or #raku-doc.  

=head2 Involvement

=head3 Getting involved

=place file:content/troupes/common/get-involved.rakudoc

=head3 Who else is involved

The primary driver of the new design is librasteve.  Other key members of the 
Raku community weigh in.  

=head3 Things that need doing

For things that need doing, see the L<raku.org Issues|https://github.com/Raku/raku.org/issues>.  

=head1 Elucid8 (for documentation)

This is only the software for making the documentation website.  For the actual 
documentation, see the L<Documentation Troupe|/content/troupes/documentation/documentation>.  

The main website for this software is at L<elucid8.org|https://elucid8.org/>.  
Reading that would be a worthwhile introduction to the project.  

=begin table
=row :header
	=cell Project/Website
	=cell Repo(s)
	=cell Description
	=cell Things we Need help with
=row
	=cell L<Elucid8|https://elucid8.org/>
	=cell L<github.com/elucid8-org|https://github.com/elucid8-org>
	=cell Documentation Framework
	=cell See issues on the repos
=row
	=cell Documentation (structure)
	=cell L<github.com/Raku/doc-website|https://github.com/Raku/doc-website>
	=cell Documentation Structure
	=cell L<Issues|https://github.com/Raku/doc-website/issues>
=end table

=head1 Activities

The things we do are:

=item Work on the Elucid8 Framework
=item Maintain the Documentation Structure for the docs.raku.org site

=head2 Resources

